    },
    "message": "Since I really only use this package myself in one specific place (now), the need for me to have this a NuGet package really no longer exists. Please continu to use the current package if you see it fit for at least some use, but I'll be removing the source code for this package (having incorporated the very small amount of code back into the single place I used the package), and marking the package as \"legacy obsolete\". As a alternative, please use System.Speech yourself directly from now, as now further versions of this package should ever appear.",
